  "doc": {
    "description": "Degenerate single-element slice In[k:k].\n\nA slice whose endpoints coincide selects exactly one bit and is\nequivalent to In[k]. Here three degenerate slices reorder a 3-bit input\nonto the output (bit 3, bit 1, bit 2) through buffers, pinning that\nIn[k:k] is a legal one-wide slice (shdl.md §6.5, §7.1 range value\ndomain — a single-value range iterates once).",
